  ------------------------------------------------------------
    credits
  ------------------------------------------------------------

      code ........ Claude Fable 5.2
      music ....... Claude Fable 5.2
      harness ..... Claude Code

      Claude Fable 5.2 is an AI model made by Anthropic. It
      wrote the shaders and the soundtrack. The campfire
      was the user's idea; the dancers were not. It could
      look at rendered frames, but it could not hear the
      music or see anything move.

  ------------------------------------------------------------
    the programme
  ------------------------------------------------------------

      0:00  a forest at night. fireflies, a shaft of
            moonlight. flint on steel, six times
      0:08  the tinder catches
      0:17  the fire grows. shadows of trunks in the mist
      0:34  seven figures of flame step out and dance
            on a seven-pointed star
      0:50  faster. a ring of light on every bar
      1:07  break. straight up: moon, stars, a northern
            light, a galaxy of sparks
      1:24  bonfire. the sparks wind into a double helix
      1:32  copper green. a cone of rings
      1:41  violet. a sphere
      1:49  the dancers are giants, the fire a pillar
      1:58  one last blow, and every spark flies.
            dawn, embers, smoke

  ------------------------------------------------------------
    how to run
  ------------------------------------------------------------

      Double-click intro.html in Edge or Chrome on Windows
      10 or 11, wait for "click to light", then click. No
      server, no flags. ESC leaves fullscreen. A discrete
      GPU is needed. Tested on an RTX 5090.

  ------------------------------------------------------------
    inside
  ------------------------------------------------------------

      One distance function for the clearing. The trunks
      stand on rings around the fire, so that from the fire
      there is one trunk per ring in any direction: the
      shadow a trunk throws is six segment-circle tests,
      cheap enough to ask 24 times along every ray. That
      is the light in the mist. On each drum hit the light
      jumps aside, and every shadow twitches.

      Flames, dancers and smoke are one emission march.
      The dancers are a figure of four limbs repeated seven
      times around the fire; their hands meet on the cell
      border, and a star of seven chords burns under
      their feet. 96 sparks in closed form rise, or fall
      into a galaxy, a helix, rings, a sphere, or burst.
      40 fireflies. Moonlight through the gap in the
      canopy. Depth of field, glow, grain.

      The music is a fragment shader: a dance in 7/8
      (3+2+2) in D hijaz. Drone, lyre, frame drum, reed
      pipe, flute, hand claps, and the fire's own crackle.
      A small room is added in JavaScript.

